        "filteredHtml": "<div role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"privacy manager\" class=\"message-container\"><div class=\"message type-modal\"><div class=\"message-stacksclose\">X</div><div class=\"message-component message-row\"><p tabindex=\"0\" class=\"focusable message-component text no-children first-focusable-el\">Your Privacy Choices</p></div><div class=\"message-component message-row content-row\"><p tabindex=\"0\" class=\"focusable message-component text no-children\">We use this information to help give you the best experience possible. This includes improved search results, more relevant content and promotions, better communication and improved site performance. Below you can adjust your cookie preferences by choosing to consent or not to certain cookies. You can also find the list of the cookies that are strictly necessary for operating the site and this ‘Manage Cookies’ center, as well as the list of vendors that place cookies on our behalf. You can find out more in our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.valnetinc.com/en/privacy-policy\" class=\"text-link-0-1-0 focusable\" aria-label=\"Privacy Policy\" tabindex=\"0\">Privacy Policy</a></p></div><div class=\"message-component message-stacks pm-tcfv2-inline no-children\"><div class=\"pm-section pm-main\"><div class=\"pm-main\"><div class=\"type-box\"><div class=\"tcfv2-stack focusable\"><div class=\"stack-row\"><h2 tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-c class=\"accordion \" lang=\"EN\"><span class=\"chevron down\"></span><span><span>Store and/or access information on a device</span></span></h2><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"pm-switch\" aria-label=\"Store and/or access information on a device\"><span class=\"slider round\"></span></button></div><div id=\"686c1b5956eb46b3bee7f757\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"panel \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"tcfv2-stack focusable\"><div class=\"stack-row\"><h2 tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-c class=\"accordion \" lang=\"EN\"><span class=\"chevron down\"></span><span></span><div class=\"stack-title\"><h3>Personalised advertising and content, advertising and content measurement, audience research and services development</h3><button class=\"pm-nswitch rejected pm-switch\"><span tabindex=\"0\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"slider round\" aria-label=\"Personalised advertising and content, advertising and content measurement, audience research and services development\"></span></button></div></h2></div><div id=\"686c1b5956eb46b3bee7f86e\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"panel \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></div><div class=\"\"></div><div class=\"type-box\"><div class=\"tcfv2-stack focusable\"><div class=\"stack-row\"><h2 tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-c class=\"accordion \" lang=\"EN\"><span class=\"chevron down\"></span><span>Special Purposes</span></h2></div><div id=\"Special Purposes\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"panel \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></div><div class=\"type-box\"><div class=\"tcfv2-stack focusable\"><div class=\"stack-row\"><h2 tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-c class=\"accordion \" lang=\"EN\"><span class=\"chevron down\"></span><span>Features</span></h2></div><div id=\"Features\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"panel \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"page-link bottom\"><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"page-desc\">We also work with some partners on the basis of legitimate interest and other legal bases without consent.</div><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"page-action\">Manage Settings</div></div><div class=\"page-link bottom\"><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"page-desc\">You can find a list of all third-party providers.</div><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"page-action\">View All Providers</div></div><div class=\"legend\"><span tabindex=\"0\" class=\"legend-key\" aria-label=\"Custom Purposes\">C</span><h2 class=\"custom-header\">Custom Purposes</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"message-component message-row bottom-row\"><button title=\"Save &amp; Exit\" aria-label=\"Save &amp; Exit\" class=\"message-component message-button no-children focusable sp_choice_type_SAVE_AND_EXIT\">Save &amp; Exit</button><button title=\"Reject All\" aria-label=\"Reject All\" class=\"message-component message-button no-children focusable sp_choice_type_REJECT_ALL\">Reject All</button><button title=\"Accept All\" aria-label=\"Accept All\" class=\"message-component message-button no-children focusable sp_choice_type_ACCEPT_ALL last-focusable-el\">Accept All</button></div></div></div>",
